        <briefdescription>
<para>Implement the combining of integral values into a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1hash__code" kindref="compound">hash_code</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This overload is selected when the value type of the iterator is integral and when the input iterator is actually a pointer. Rather than computing a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1hash__code" kindref="compound">hash_code</ref> for each object and then combining them, this (as an optimization) directly combines the integers. Also, because the integers are stored in contiguous memory, this routine avoids copying each value and directly reads from the underlying memory. </para>
